# State

Default to `useState` and Context for simple shared state.

Use Zustand only when at least one of these is true:

- Context re-renders hurt performance
- State must persist
- Middleware is required
- Global state has many actions

Justify Zustand in the PR description.

Details: `docs/frontend/tools/STATE_MANAGEMENT.md`
